BT /F2 15.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 781.9 Tm (22. If rebuilding this from scratch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 751.0 Tm (Six things are worth more than the rest of the document put together, because each was learned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 737.4 Tm (by getting it wrong first.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 717.0 Tm (1. **Decide tempo and metre together.** Sequential estimation produces confident, wrong,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 703.4 Tm (self-consistent answers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 689.8 Tm (2. **Detect the loop before comparing bars.** On repetitive music, position in the loop beats) Tj ET
